Selling & Marketing Exp |      1741.38 |      1767.68 |      1606.51 |      1682.15 |\n| R&D Exp                 |      1513.89 |      1538.98 |      1404.70 |      1409.56 |\n| General & Admin Exp     |       997.85 |       996.16 |      1028.22 |      1017.09 |\n| Operating Income        |      3726.70 |      2826.23 |      3093.30 |      2919.12 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |        18.28 |        15.77 |        17.34 |        16.82 |\n| Net Income              |      3334.16 |      3103.44 |      1988.96 |      2734.00 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |        16.36 |        17.32 |        11.15 |        15.76 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |      1113.28 |       903.40 |       490.08 |      2464.34 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |     -2890.32 |     -1060.99 |     -1229.44 |      -846.39 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |       290.91 |         1.35 |      -138.55 |      -457.99 |\n| CAPEX                   |      -736.89 |      -906.77 |      -700.08 |      -689.58 |"
